This is an all-size identification, not an inference from the displayed prefix: the owned decomposition of
full wiring diagrams into connected pieces underlying (6) identifies Ad with that class for every d. Thus
ad = Xd in the notation of Alman–Lian–Tran. Their Theorem 4.1.6 gives the full-wiring recurrence, Re-
mark 4.1.7 identifies the sequence A111088, Theorem 4.1.8 gives its coefficient identity, and Theorem 4.2.1
gives its asymptotic [2]. All of those enumerative facts, as well as the transform itself, receive zero credit
here.
